{"lesson_uid":"L0176","_provenance":{"generator":"backend/scripts/generate_lesson_zhuyin.py","reading_authority":"frontend/src/components/zhuyin/polyphonicProcessor.ts（跑，非移植）","source_font":"frontend/public/fonts/BpmfZihiSerif-Regular.ttf","font_sha256_16":"fc25a90d27699ec4","poyin_db_sha256_16":"2d4d4c9f1d0ec1a6","notation":"pypinyin BopomofoConverter（與 font_readings.json 同一個轉換器）","stats":{"texts":228,"chars":5862,"poly_positions":1681,"he_adjudicated":2,"xiang_adjudicated":0,"manual_corrections":0}},"texts":[{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9qjnx","idx":1,"text":"無論是班上選幹部、參加接力，或在球隊爭取先發，我們都可能遇到和自己能力相近的人。看見對方進步，有人會替他高興，也有人忍不住擔心：「他會不會超過我？我的機會是不是變少了？」","n":85,"ssz":"..............................1....1.................1.....1.......1..........1......"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9qjnx","idx":2,"text":"棒球隊的佳恩也有這樣的煩惱。","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9qjnx","idx":3,"text":"佳恩和子皓都是捕手，也都想成為先發球員。佳恩接球穩、傳球快，能迅速把球傳向二壘，阻止跑者盜壘；子皓善於觀察，常能看出打者的習慣，提醒投手改變投球方式。他們平時一起練習，心裡卻難免暗自較勁：誰今天被教練稱讚？下一場比賽，誰會先上場？","n":115,"ssz":"..11...........................................1...............................2........................2.........."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9qjnx","idx":4,"text":"有一天，子皓在練習阻擋偏低的球時，總是來不及移動，讓球從身旁滾走。他去請教佳恩，佳恩明知道方法，卻只回答：「沒事啦，多練習就會了。」他不是討厭子皓，只是心裡有所顧忌。這個念頭讓他把真正想分享的方法吞了回去：如果全部教給子皓，子皓變得比自己更強，自己的先發位置會不會就難保了？","n":137,"ssz":".2..1..............................................................1...1............1........................1..1..1..............1......"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9qjnx","idx":5,"text":"幾天後的比賽，佳恩擔任先發捕手，前幾局傳接十分流暢，還抓到一名想盜壘的跑者。但到了後半場，佳恩的膝蓋卻隱隱作痛。他咬牙繼續蹲著，動作卻明顯遲鈍。教練察覺不對勁，立刻把他換下場，改由子皓接替。","n":95,"ssz":".............................2..............................................1.............1...."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9qjnx","idx":6,"text":"子皓一上場就十分忐忑。沒過多久，投手投出一顆偏低的球。子皓來不及用身體擋住，球從旁邊滾到後方。壘上的跑者趁機跑上三壘，下一名打者又敲出安打，跑者回到本壘，球隊失去了原本的領先。","n":88,"ssz":"1.1.................2......1................................2..........................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9qjnx","idx":7,"text":"比賽結束，佳恩坐在休息區，懊惱自己的膝蓋不爭氣，也忍不住想：「如果我沒有被換下場，也許就不會輸了。」教練看見垂頭喪氣的佳恩，走到他身旁坐下。「你覺得今天為什麼沒守住？」教練問。佳恩低著頭說：「因為我的膝蓋痛，不能繼續上場。」教練看了看他正在冰敷的膝蓋，說：「受傷當然會影響比賽。不過，沒有人能保證自己每天都不累、不受傷。」","n":161,"ssz":"..........................1.................1............................1..1....................1.........................................1.............1..1...."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9qjnx","idx":8,"text":"教練接著說：「今天這場比賽讓我們看見一件事：如果先發捕手突然不能上場，另一個捕手也要能立刻接上。這不是你一個人的責任，也不是子皓一個人的責任，是整支球隊都要準備好的事。你們爭取先發沒有錯，但同一個位置的隊友，不只是競爭者，也是彼此的後盾，是最能互相提醒、互相補位的最佳拍檔。」","n":138,"ssz":"..................1.................11...........1..11......1.1.11..............................11.........................1....1........."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9qjnx","idx":9,"text":"佳恩想起幾天前，子皓來請教時，自己明明知道方法，卻只說了一句：「多練習就會了。」再想到那顆從子皓身旁滾過去的球，他的心裡一沉，曬的黑亮的臉龐頓時微微發燙。","n":77,"ssz":"........1...................1.................1.............2................"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9qjnx","idx":10,"text":"從那天起，佳恩主動分享接球的訣竅，子皓也會把自己觀察打者的方法告訴佳恩。他們仍然會比較，也都希望自己能先發上場。不同的是，他們不再只想：「我一定要贏過他」，也會問自己：「他哪裡做得比我好？我能從他身上學到什麼？」","n":106,"ssz":".................1.............................................1......1..................1................"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9qjnx","idx":11,"text":"面對競爭，我們有時會落入「我好，你不好」、「你好，我不好」的想法。如果他進步了，我的機會就變少；如果他表現不好，我反而暗自鬆一口氣。可是，一個人變強，不一定代表另一個人就會變弱。真正能讓團隊變好的態度會是「我好，你也好」。這態度不是放棄競爭，而是互為後盾，兩個人都相信：我可以努力發揮自己的長處，也可以幫助隊友一起進步。兩個人都變強，整支球隊才有更多機會走得更遠。","n":182,"ssz":"..............................................................2......11.....1....11...............................1..............1..1.............1........2.....1................1..."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9qjnx","idx":12,"text":"多年以後，球員可能記不得每場比賽的分數，也未必記得自己得過幾座獎盃。但他們往往會記得那些一起練習到天黑、輸球後互相打氣，以及在自己快撐不住時，伸手接住自己的隊友。","n":81,"ssz":"...........1............1..1.............1..2...........1..........1............."},{"section":"key_reading","slug":"ww3ve","idx":null,"text":"教練接著說：「今天這場比賽讓我們看見一件事：如果先發捕手突然不能上場，另一個捕手也要能立刻接上。這不是你一個人的責任，也不是子皓一個人的責任，是整支球隊都要準備好的事。你們爭取先發沒有錯，但同一個位置的隊友，不只是競爭者，也是彼此的後盾，是最能互相提醒、互相補位的最佳拍檔。」佳恩想起幾天前，子皓來請教時，自己明明知道方法，卻只說了一句：「多練習就會了。」再想到那顆從子皓身旁滾過去的球，他的心裡一沉，曬的黑亮的臉龐頓時微微發燙。從那天起，佳恩主動分享接球的訣竅，子皓也會把自己觀察打者的方法告訴佳恩。他們仍然會比較，也都希望自己能先發上場。不同的是，他們不再只想：「我一定要贏過他」，也會問自己：「他哪裡做得比我好？我能從他身上學到什麼？」","n":321,"ssz":"..................1.................11...........1..11......1.1.11..............................11.........................1....1.................1...................1.................1.............2.................................1.............................................1......1..................1................"},{"section":"served:lesson_code","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"體-L12","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:series","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"體育生","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:grade","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"品格教育","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一起變強，會更好","n":8,"ssz":"2......."},{"section":"served:genre","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"議論文","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"品格力──我好，你也好","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:intro.background","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章從球隊裡兩位捕手的故事出發，談面對能力相近的隊友時，那種既想進步又怕被超越的心情。佳恩因為擔心先發位置不保，把接球的方法留了下來；一場比賽的失誤與教練的提醒，讓他重新看見同位置的隊友「不只是競爭者，也是最佳拍檔」。文章接著介紹「我好，你也好」「我好，你不好」「我不好，你好」「我不好，你也不好」四種心理地位，並用辨別練習與情境題，帶讀者練習從話語中認出彼此的互動位置，再有意識地把自己調整回「肯定自己也肯定他人」的位置。","n":214,"ssz":".......................1........................1....................2...............1................................................................................................................................"},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀全文-做記號","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"念順順","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞我最棒","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞應用","n":4,"ssz":"..1."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"五","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章重點表","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"六","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"品格聚光燈","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].subtitle","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我好，你也好","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"七","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀理解","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"八","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"詞語複習","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"九","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"知識補給站","n":5,"ssz":"...1."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"忐忑","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"心裡不安、緊張，不能平靜。","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"顧忌","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為有所擔心顧慮，而不敢放心去做。","n":17,"ssz":".1..............."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"先發","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"比賽一開始就上場的球員。","n":12,"ssz":"..2........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"垂頭喪氣","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為失敗或不順利而很失望、沒精神。","n":17,"ssz":".1...1..........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"難保","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"難以保留。","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"後盾","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在背後支持、幫助自己的人或力量。","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"拍檔","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"經常一起合作的夥伴。","n":10,"ssz":"..2......."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"訣竅","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"做好一件事的重要方法。","n":11,"ssz":"..1........"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"暗自較勁","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"心裡偷偷和別人比較。","n":10,"ssz":"....1....."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"懊惱","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為事情沒做好而生氣、後悔。","n":14,"ssz":".1............"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[10].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"頓時","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[10].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一下子；立刻。","n":7,"ssz":"1.1...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[11].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"隱隱作痛","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[11].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"身體有輕微、不太明顯的疼痛。","n":14,"ssz":"......1......."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[0].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"籃球比賽最後一秒被對手逆轉，大家都（　）的走回休息區。","n":27,"ssz":"......2...................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[1].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"每當她遇到挫折，家人總是給她鼓勵，成為她最可靠的（　）。","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[2].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他知道自己闖禍後，（　）地走進辦公室，不知如何向老師說明。","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[3].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他們兩個在球隊上稱兄道弟，但也常（　），希望得到教練賞識。","n":29,"ssz":"...1........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"昨天跑完八百公尺後，他的腳踝到今天還有些（　）。","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哥哥告訴我，背英文單字的（　）不是重複抄寫，而是常常複習。","n":29,"ssz":".1.............1.1..........."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他想在小組討論時提出不同意見，卻（　）同學的感受，沒有開口。","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老師宣布明天的考試延期，全班同學（　）鬆了一口氣。","n":25,"ssz":".....................2..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列選項中「  」的語詞，何者使用正確？","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他心中有很厚的「後盾」，任何鼓勵和建議他都聽不進去","n":25,"ssz":"................1.....1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我很感謝他對我的「顧忌」，幫助我度過許多困難時刻","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"當他看見思念的家人出現在火車站，「頓時」熱淚盈眶","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他因為緊張所以說話「忐忑」，讓人聽不懂他在說什麼","n":24,"ssz":"..1....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據第九段，佳恩看到子皓失誤，後來「心裡一沉，曬得黑亮的臉龐頓時微微發燙」，最可能表示他當時有什麼感受？","n":52,"ssz":"..........1.........2...1..........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他因為子皓失誤而偷偷感到有些開心和得意","n":19,"ssz":"..11............1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他想到自己曾經故意不分享方法，感到慚愧","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他擔心教練會責怪自己無法上場讓球隊失分","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他認為子皓不適合擔任捕手，因此感到生氣","n":19,"ssz":"...1.1............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據第十一段，「一個人變強，不一定代表另一個人就會變弱。」這句話在本文中最接近下列哪一個意思？","n":47,"ssz":"........11.....1....11....................11.2."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"別人的進步不一定會搶走自己的機會，彼此也可能一起變好","n":26,"ssz":"......1...............2..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"別人能力變強時，自己更應專心提升自己，不必再分享方法","n":26,"ssz":"...................1......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"團隊合作比競爭重要，因此同位置的隊友不應再爭取先發","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"能力和位置相近的隊友最好不要比較，避免影響彼此的感情","n":26,"ssz":"..1..1......1............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據本文，下列何者最符合文章主旨？","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"球員應該先把自己的基本動作練熟，才能及時幫助隊友","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"面對競爭時，應該避免比較，才能維持良好的人際關係","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"競爭不必建立在壓過別人，也可以彼此學習、一起進步","n":24,"ssz":"..1.................2..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"團隊比賽中，替補球員的能力往往比先發球員更加重要","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"班上要派代表參加朗讀比賽，小庭和好友都很想入選，看著好友的進步，小庭開始擔心自己。哪種想法最符合本文所強調的態度？","n":57,"ssz":"...............1....................................1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「她進步得這麼快，我最好不要再把練習方法告訴她。」","n":25,"ssz":"....1.......1............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「既然她現在比我好，我乾脆不要參加，免得最後失望。」","n":26,"ssz":".............1.....1......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「為了維持友情，我們兩個都不要參加，這樣最公平。」","n":25,"ssz":".1.........1.1..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「我可以繼續爭取，也看看她進步的方法，彼此一起練習。」","n":27,"ssz":".....................2....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＜200字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還要多加練習。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"201~230字","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞231字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（八☞）開始朗讀，在表格中記錄1分鐘朗讀的字數。如果計時3次後，你對自己還不滿意，可以多練幾次。最後一次，找一位同學，請他計時、記錄並簽名！","n":81,"ssz":".............................................................1...1..............."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"教練接著說：「今天這場比賽讓我們看見一件事：如果","n":24,"ssz":"..................1....."},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"和別人相處時，我們心裡常常會比較：誰比較厲害？誰做得比較好？有時候，我們會因為怕自己輸，而希望別人不要太好；有時候，也會覺得別人什麼都比自己強。子皓和佳恩的故事告訴我們，在團隊裡，「我好，你也好」的互動，是一種比較健康的選擇。","n":113,"ssz":"1..1.....................1............1..........1...........1..........1.1............................2........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎情境回顧：先從佳恩的故事來看看：子皓來請教接球的方法時，佳恩心裡想：「如果全部教給子皓，子皓變得比自己更強，自己的先發位置會不會就難保了？」請問佳恩當時最接近哪一種想法？","n":86,"ssz":".................1........................1..1..1..............1.................2...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請問佳恩當時最接近哪一種想法？","n":15,"ssz":"..........2...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我有我的長處，子皓也有他的長處。","n":16,"ssz":".....1.1......1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我希望自己比較好，子皓不要變得比我更強。","n":20,"ssz":".........1.1..1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"子皓比我厲害，我再努力也沒有用。","n":16,"ssz":"1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們兩個都不可能成為好捕手。","n":14,"ssz":"...1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→佳恩並不是討厭子皓，而是擔心：如果你好了，我可能就不好了。這種想法和我們怎麼看「自己」與「別人」有關。","n":52,"ssz":"....1...1.........................1................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎心理地位介紹：一個人心裡怎麼看自己、怎麼看別人，大致可能出現下面四種想法。","n":38,"ssz":"........11............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].headers[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"心理地位","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].headers[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"心裡的想法","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].headers[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"可能說出的話","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[0][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我有我的長處，你也有你的長處。","n":15,"ssz":".....1.......1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[0][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「你做得好的地方我可以學，我會的也可以和你分享。」","n":25,"ssz":"...1...............1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[1][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我好，你不好","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[1][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我比較好，你比較差。","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[1][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「你們都不會，還是我自己做比較快。」","n":18,"ssz":"....1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[2][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我不好，你好","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[2][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"你比較好，我比不上你。","n":11,"ssz":".......1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[2][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「你那麼厲害，我怎麼努力都沒用。」","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[3][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我不好，你也不好","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[3][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我不行，你也好不到哪裡去。","n":13,"ssz":".......1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].rows[3][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「反正我們都做不好，算了啦！」","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→「我好，你也好」不是說大家都一樣厲害、不用比較，而是「我看見自己的價值，也看見別人的價值。」","n":47,"ssz":".........1.....1....1.........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎辨別練習：我們會肯定自己也會否定自己；會肯定他人也會否定他人，而這就構成了互動中不同的心理地位。請根據底下的話語判斷這句話屬於哪一種心理地位。","n":72,"ssz":".................................................................2......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.小宇在小組報告時說：「你們都不會做，還是全部交給我比較快。」","n":32,"ssz":"................1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→這想法是（　）自己","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"肯定","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"否定","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（　）他人","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→心理地位屬於","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.小哲看到同學這次考得比自己好，心想：「他本來就比我聰明，我再怎麼讀也不可能追上他。」","n":44,"ssz":"...........1................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.小安說：「小晴的英文比我好，我可以跟他學；我的數學比她強，也可以幫她準備考試。」","n":42,"ssz":".........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→當你能夠從語言中辨識出彼此互動的心理地位時，也就可以有意識的去調整，把自己放回「肯定自己也肯定他人」的位置。","n":55,"ssz":"......................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎情境練習：根據下列情境，選出「我好，你也好」的想法。","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.你和朋友都想參加學校的數理競賽。這次考試，他的成績比你好。哪一個想法比較接近「我好，你也好」？","n":49,"ssz":"...1............................11..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他最好下次考差一點，我才有機會。","n":16,"ssz":".......2........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他這次準備得比我好，我可以向他請教。","n":18,"ssz":".....1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"反正我比不上他，不如乾脆不要準備了。","n":18,"ssz":"....1.......1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他本來就比我聰明，我大概沒有希望了。","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.你的組員很會做簡報，但不太敢上臺；你很會口頭報告，但對電腦操作比較不熟。怎麼做比較接近「我好，你也好」？","n":54,"ssz":".............1........................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我比較會說，所以整份報告都照我的方法做。","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他簡報做得這麼好，我在這組好像沒什麼用。","n":20,"ssz":"....1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們各有擅長的地方，可以分工，也可以互相教對方。","n":24,"ssz":"...................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們兩個都有不會的地方，隨便完成就好了。","n":20,"ssz":"...1..1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.你和好朋友一起參加才藝表演甄選，最後只有朋友入選。哪一個想法比較接近「我好，你也好」？","n":45,"ssz":"...1...2....................11..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他入選，就表示我一定比他差。","n":14,"ssz":"........1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"希望他之後出錯，證明老師選錯人。","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"以後我們都不要參加，就不會互相比較了。","n":19,"ssz":".....1.....1..1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我很替他高興，也看看自己可以加強的部分。","n":20,"ssz":".....1............1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎調整一下","n":5,"ssz":"...1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"4.小哲想：「他期中考考那麼好，他本來就比我聰明，我再怎麼讀也追不上。」哪一個想法比較能把自己調整回「我好，你也好」？","n":59,"ssz":"................................1....11...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他比較聰明，智商是天生的，比也比不過，我還是不要跟他比。","n":28,"ssz":"................1.....1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"太丟臉了，我下次一定要贏他，拚死拚活也要證明我也很厲害。","n":28,"ssz":"........1..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他這次表現比我好，我可以學他；我也可以找出自己能加強的地方。","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"反正考試只是運氣，起起落落，要看開一點，太在乎是沒有用的。","n":29,"ssz":".................2..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[18].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→「我好，你也好」不是放棄自己，也不是壓過別人，而是既肯定自己，也肯定別人。遇到比較或挫折時，可以問自己：1.我還可以做什麼讓自己進步？2.對方有哪些地方值得我學習或支持？這樣就比較容易回到「我好，你也好」的位置。","n":107,"ssz":".........1.......1............................................................1............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].items[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我能辨認「我好，你也好」和另外三種互動位置。","n":22,"ssz":"............1........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].items[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我能發現自己什麼時候在否定自己或否定別人。","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].items[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遇到比較時，我能提醒自己：我可以繼續努力，也可以看見別人值得學習的地方。","n":36,"ssz":".............................1......"},{"section":"served:keypoints.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"結構","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段落","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"內容","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].結構","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"引出問題","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].內容","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遇到和自己能力【　】的人，看見對方進步，有的人會替他開心，但也有人會忍不住【　】，害怕自己的機會【　】。","n":52,"ssz":"..1................................1................"},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].內容_blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"相近","n":2,"ssz":"1."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].內容_blanks[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"擔心","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[0].內容_blanks[2].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"變少","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].結構","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"問題","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].內容[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.佳恩和子皓都是隊上的【　】，他們的風格不同，都想成為【　】球員。","n":34,"ssz":"....11............................"},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].內容[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.子皓向佳恩請教，佳恩（），擔心如果子皓變強，自己先發的位置就【　】","n":35,"ssz":"..1................1..............."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].內容_blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"捕手","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:keypoints.rows[1].內容_sub_questions[0].st